1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,059
Legacy banking software often has no usable API.

2
00:00:03,059 --> 00:00:06,500
Staff still search records and copy values by hand.

3
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:09,559
Swivel turns that work into a reusable capability.

4
00:00:09,559 --> 00:00:11,853
A model learns the workflow once.

5
00:00:11,853 --> 00:00:17,588
Deterministic automation replays it, and a person takes over when the system cannot safely continue.

6
00:00:19,588 --> 00:00:22,965
This is the working demo, using synthetic bank data.

7
00:00:22,965 --> 00:00:25,217
Choose a scenario and run it.

8
00:00:25,217 --> 00:00:30,846
Swivel opens Chromium, signs into the legacy bank, searches for the member, and reads the

9
00:00:30,846 --> 00:00:31,596
savings balances.

10
00:00:31,596 --> 00:00:33,848
The result comes from the application.

11
00:00:33,848 --> 00:00:37,600
Replay makes zero model calls, and every step leaves evidence.

12
00:00:39,600 --> 00:00:43,141
The capability is more than a click recording.

13
00:00:43,141 --> 00:00:48,895
It declares typed inputs and outputs, permitted actions, business outcomes, and success checks.

14
00:00:48,895 --> 00:00:52,435
Targets use names, nearby captions, and table relationships.

15
00:00:52,435 --> 00:00:58,189
The saved OpenAI discovery completed seven model turns and produced six reusable steps.

16
00:00:58,189 --> 00:01:01,730
That exact artifact also passed a deterministic replay.

17
00:01:03,730 --> 00:01:07,214
A missing member is a business outcome, not a crash.

18
00:01:07,214 --> 00:01:12,441
A session timeout is different: the engine signs back in and safely restarts because no

19
00:01:12,441 --> 00:01:14,183
irreversible work has been committed.

20
00:01:14,183 --> 00:01:16,274
These scenarios exercise the real browser.

21
00:01:16,274 --> 00:01:20,107
The evidence shows which signal fired and how the engine responded.

22
00:01:22,107 --> 00:01:26,530
Here the second institution hides its deposit accounts behind a Display button.

23
00:01:26,530 --> 00:01:30,584
Without the tenant overlay, the engine refuses to guess and pauses.

24
00:01:30,584 --> 00:01:34,638
The operator claims the ticket and sees the same live browser.

25
00:01:34,638 --> 00:01:37,956
I click Display Deposit Accounts and hand control back.

26
00:01:37,956 --> 00:01:40,904
Automation then reads the balances and verifies success.

27
00:01:40,904 --> 00:01:43,484
The operator action stays in the evidence.

28
00:01:45,484 --> 00:01:51,356
Swivel includes the source, a concise design report, genuine
discovery evidence, and repeatable acceptance checks.

29
00:01:51,356 --> 00:01:54,096
The interface works on desktop and mobile.

30
00:01:54,096 --> 00:01:58,010
The public sandbox is bounded and uses synthetic records only.

31
00:01:58,010 --> 00:02:01,533
Try it at swivel demo dot web dot app.

32
00:02:01,533 --> 00:02:02,707
Learn it once.

33
00:02:02,707 --> 00:02:04,272
Run it with confidence.
